<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (The Coupon & Discount Manager demonstrates how a Binary Search Tree, a HashMap, a greedy strategy, sorting and file handling can be combined to manage coupons and choose the best valid discount for a bill. It also shows how validation rules such as date range, usage limit and duplicate codes keep the data correct. The project is simple and easy to demonstrate, and it can be extended in the future with the features listed under Future Scope.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
